From 721629f14840483b805dd11acbd550b2b27d3a00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marcelo Ferreira <marcelo@fulltour.com.br>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 17:30:45 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Simplify OTA: check-only, no auto-download/flash

- Remove ota_url_task()/handle_ota_url() (HTTP download + Update.begin
  auto-flash mechanism) and the /ota_url POST route.
- Remove the 'Firmware Update' button and its JS handler from the About
  page. 'Check New Version' now only reports availability and updates
  the firmware file link; installing requires downloading the .bin and
  using the existing Manual Firmware Update upload control.
- Drop fs_version/fs_update_available tracking from handle_check_version()
  and the Icons/Data status row, since firmware+icons now ship together
  via the one-click ESP Web Tools installer (fsversion.txt no longer
  needs to be read for this check).
---
 src/webservice.cpp | 156 ++-------------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 150 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/webservice.cpp b/src/webservice.cpp
index 13dd0f1..15628d1 100644
